<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Israel Yoba Kingno, Buk 2</para>
  <para style="toc2">Israel Yoba Kingno, Buk 2</para>
  <para style="toc1">Israel Yoba Kingno, Buk 2</para>
  <para style="mt">Israel Yoba Kingno, Buk 2</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Ana king Ahas dumo Juda bugla yugu 11-pela sugl mogl kodidre, bugla yugu 12-pela sugl moglkwa igne, Hosia, yagl ta kagie Ela we digwa wam moglkwa i, ye u Israel yoba kingno moglkwa. Ye king moglsre, bugla yugu 9-pela taun Samaria mogl, Israel yoba sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Ye Israel yoba sugl moglsre, Yawe gumuglo wagle mabuno kide boglkwa. Ye mabuno kide boglkwa ba Israel yoba kingno okna meglkwa i, mabuno kide kaima beglko, Hosia mabuno kide kebra dagl boglkwa. <verse eid="2KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Ye yegl eruko, Asiria king, kagie Salmaneser we digwa i, ere mogl, Israel kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erukwa. Yobuglo erukwa pre Hosia ye moglmara atne kra moglsre, bugla yugu swara swarade taks togwa. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Yegl ere ede ogwa ba bugla yugu swara ta ye mogl pere edenagledi yoba tau dedugo, ye ede pi Isip king, kagie So we digwa i moglmara pidre, Ene no ake ple di noratne digwa. Digo, Hosia bugla yugu swara swarade taks tomere yegl tekrukwa. Yegl eruko, yoba tau prisre, Asiria king di teigo, ye soldia tau dedugo, ye Hosia si kane si i pi kane yugu edigwa. <figure style="fig" alt="Going into captivity" file="C047 bw OT.tif" size="span" copy="Ethnos360" ref="17.6">Kuda ikne Israel yoba yobuglo ere tedre, si kane si ede eigwa</figure><verse eid="2KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Ana ye Hosia si kane sigwa, kane paugo, Asiria king ere mogl, amimo bogl dumo Israel mudu kuda bogl tedre, ede u taun Samaria yobugl winabo di i suna edidre, bugla yugu suota kuda bogl teigwa. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Ye bugla yugu suota kuda bogl tedre, Hosia bugla yugu 9-pela Israel kingno moglkwa igne, ye yobuglo ersre, dumo Samaria igwa. Dumo Samaria idre, Israel yoba si kane si i pi dumo Asiria suna moraiglmedi edigwa. Tau dumo Hala we dimara edidre, tau dumo Habor, nigl Gosan bina i edidre, tau Midia yoba kipai meglmara edigwa.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Yubun podo i Israel yoba melgmara plau dugwa i, mabuno yegl paugwa, Israel yoba kowano awano okna Isip king moglmara atne meglkwa ba Yawe ye mogl pere edidre, dumo Isip kide kodinaiglmedi agre i ede meda ugwa. Ye Israel yoba yegl ere togwa ba Israel yoba ere mogl, ye Godno Yawe gumuglo wagle tadaglme ersre, god kibi kamage ere tedre, kagno kade teigwa. <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />Te, Kenan yoba okna dumo Kenan suna meglkwa i, Yawe ye Israel yoba dumo Kenan moraiglmedi Kenan yoba si i pi meda edugwa. Yegl erukwa ba Israel yoba ere mogl, Kenan yoba mabuno kide beglmere yegl beglko, Israel king ama mabuno kide kor tau Israel yoba boraiglmedi obuno di teigo, beglkwa.<verse eid="2KI 17:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Ana Juda yoba kingno Sedekaia, ye yobama bogl Babilon king no sugl moglkran, mogl pere edinamnedi prisre, Babilon king kamo sedigwa pre Babilon king, kagie Nebukatnesar we digwa i, ere mogl, amimo bogl ede u dumo Jerusalem kuda bogl tenamnedi sel yugu kipai, Jerusalem yobugl winabo di i suna edigwa. Edidre, ye kobuglo togl erimara ede kuglo enamnedi makan si yu kobuglo togl yomara magigl i edigwa. King Nebukatnesar amimo bogl kuda bogl tenamnedi wigwa igne i Sedekaia, bugla yugu 9 dumo Juda sugl moglko, 10 mun, de 10 mina King Nebukatnesar amimo bogl wigwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Babilon yoba ba tau mere Jerusalem yobugl winabo di i suna ede pai meglko, king Sedekaia bugla yugu 11 Juda sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Winabo di i suna ede pai meglko, 4 mun, de 9 ege, Jerusalem yoba kidan podo paigo, kaya mokna nenaiglkwa taragl swara kaima ta yekrukwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Ta yekrukwa igne i Babilon yoba kobuglo togl bage ta si buko didre, ede Jerusalem suna eigwa. Suna eigo, king Sedekaia amimo bogl eduer mudu teke enamnedi ede pi king kaya moknamo ere yaiglmara pidre, kobuglo togl suo ta magigl magigl yebrara dua ta yomara i ede meda eigwa. Babilon yoba dumo Jerusalem winabo di i suna ede pai meglkwa ba ye teke ede pi nigl Jordan omara dumo auduno yogwa i, enamnedi eigwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Teke ede pi dumo i enamnedi eigwa ba Babilon soldia ye sika si pi taun Jeriko yomara dumo auduno yogwa i pidre, ye sigwa. Ye pi sigo, Sedekaia amimo ede pere pere eigwa.<verse eid="2KI 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Ana Sedekaia amimo ede pere pere eigo, Babilon yoba king Sedekaia si kane si i pi king Nebukatnesar dumo Ribla we digwa i moglmara edigwa. Edigo, king Nebukatnesar ye Sedekaia kotmo prisre, kumapmo tenagle dugwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Yegl didre, ye yobama di togo, ye Sedekaia gumuglo wagle wam mudu si goglsre, Sedekaia gumuglo si kin yedre, sen ta taragl bras mina bekigwa idre, ye si kane si i pi dumo Babilon edigwa.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Ana king Nebukatnesar dumo Babilon bugla yugu 19 sugl moglmara suna i, ba 5 mun, de 7 mina ye yobamo kade ta, kagie Nebusaradan we digwa i, ede dumo Jerusalem ugwa. Yagl i, soldia tau king sugl meglkwa i bitno moglkwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Ye ede Jerusalem udre, Yawe yugumo ya king yugumo ya yoba kade Jerusalem suna kipaigwa i yuguno mudu gagl tege ere kodugwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Gagl tege ere kodidre, ye ami di togo, ye mudu ere mogl, Jerusalem kobuglo togl ere winabo digwa i mudu si atne edigwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Si atne edigo, Nebusaradan Juda yoba tau dumo Jerusalem pai meglkwa i ya tau okna kuda panarukwa igne teke ede pi Babilon yoba meglmara eigwa i ya Juda yoba mudu magigl meglkwa i, si kane si i pi dumo Babilon edenagledi ede ogwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Yegl erukwa ba ye Juda yoba goduglme meglkwa i tau dumo Juda pai mogl, kaya mokna ere yaglsre, ede wain sugl moraiglmedi kanige erukwa.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>